msgid ""
"**SDD mean.** 1.75 → 3.00 (+1.25). **TDD mean.** 2.00 → 2.75 (+0.75). **MDD "
"mean.** 1.50 → 1.50 (+0.00). **Overall.** 1.75 → 2.42 (+0.67)."
