msgid "Rubric — what each score means"
msgstr "评分尺 —— 每一档分数的含义"

#: ../../source/chapters/13-appendices/d-harnesscard.md:152
#: ba930faa41b54f1e84ebefe9acb8bf0f
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Every cell score is a 0–5 integer. The rubric is pinned to CAR-HarnessCard "
"v0.2 {cite}`car2025decomposition` and applies uniformly across all twelve "
"cells."
msgstr ""
"每一格的得分都是 0–5 的整数。这把评分尺钉在 CAR-HarnessCard v0.2 {cite}`car2025decomposition` "
"上，十二格通用。"

#: ../../source/chapters/13-appendices/d-harnesscard.md:74
#: e3267efff77b4f38af55962e82b01303
msgid "Score"
msgstr "得分"

#: ../../source/chapters/13-appendices/d-harnesscard.md:74
#: 6c178d75c50e47ac946227c597424890
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../source/chapters/13-appendices/d-harnesscard.md:74
#: 75830683db5244059b57c752fc285d14
msgid "**0**"
msgstr "**0**"

#: ../../source/chapters/13-appendices/d-harnesscard.md:74
#: 3f30174b275c4990909673389169e4fa
msgid ""
"No artefact of any kind for this cell. The guardian × zone intersection is "
"absent."
msgstr "这一格没有任何形式的制品。这个\"护法 × 区域\"交点是空缺的。"

#: ../../source/chapters/13-appendices/d-harnesscard.md:74
#: 4f951cafb3d74bee8cfc555e4dfb99b5
msgid "**1**"
msgstr "**1**"

#: ../../source/chapters/13-appendices/d-harnesscard.md:74
#: c05634168d504c30869a3b05f1d938b4
msgid ""
"An ad-hoc artefact exists but is not invoked on a cadence and carries no "
"owner."
msgstr "存在一件临时凑的制品，但并未按节奏被调用，也无人署名持有。"

#: ../../source/chapters/13-appendices/d-harnesscard.md:74
#: c0a5a4f687ef4bec8f0848b17aa6ad23
msgid "**2**"
msgstr "**2**"

#: ../../source/chapters/13-appendices/d-harnesscard.md:74
#: c22c920df14d424c87f9bbe3a5ff2b5b
msgid ""
"A committed artefact exists; a named role owns it; review cadence is "
"irregular."
msgstr "存在一件已提交的制品；有一位署名角色持有它；评审节奏不规律。"

#: ../../source/chapters/13-appendices/d-harnesscard.md:74
#: 80b195d3ec7c417588eda6a8760c780c
msgid "**3**"
msgstr "**3**"

#: ../../source/chapters/13-appendices/d-harnesscard.md:74
#: 6a36db2fbc6d4e068defbbf0cbfbdd77
msgid ""
"Artefact, owner, and cadence all present; the artefact is read by agents "
"(SDD/TDD rows) or scraped (MDD row)."
msgstr "制品、所有者、节奏三者俱全；该制品被智能体读取（SDD／TDD 行）或被抓取（MDD 行）。"

#: ../../source/chapters/13-appendices/d-harnesscard.md:74
#: ace9a0e679f94d528381184c80e83eb2
msgid "**4**"
msgstr "**4**"

#: ../../source/chapters/13-appendices/d-harnesscard.md:74
#: acbc5228242d422087368c5da47c1f20
msgid ""
"Artefact is *enforced* — failure blocks commits, merges, or releases as "
"appropriate."
msgstr "该制品是 *被强制执行* 的 —— 不合格会按情况挡住 commit、合并或发布。"

#: ../../source/chapters/13-appendices/d-harnesscard.md:74
#: dc888058aa9b4d97ae5c718d22851250
msgid "**5**"
msgstr "**5**"

#: ../../source/chapters/13-appendices/d-harnesscard.md:74
#: e82369e3fada477d9b964a08482b7f26
msgid ""
"Enforced **and** machine-verifiable **and** the artefact itself is revised "
"on a declared cadence (quarterly or faster)."
msgstr "被强制执行，**而且** 可被机器验证，**而且** 制品本身按一份声明过的节奏（季度或更快）被修订。"

#: ../../source/chapters/13-appendices/d-harnesscard.md:165
#: 016ef30e550e4cb7b304a3776c7ec2ca
msgid ""
"A score of 4 requires an enforcement mechanism; a score of 5 additionally "
